  "title": "Missouri’s Paid Sick Leave Law Takes Effect May 1, 2025: What Employers Need to Do Now",
  "summary": "Whether or not Proposition A is modified later this year, its sick leave provisions are set to become law in just a few weeks. Failure to comply could result in penalties, lost employee trust, and increased legal risk. Stay ahead of the curve by taking steps now to align your policies, practices, and communications with the law as written.",
